      "config": {
        "inputMode": "structured",
        "structuredFields": [
          {
            "name": "context",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "description": "High-value context to submit to MindAtlas. It should ideally include what happened, the result, why it matters, and any clear time clues."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "tool_types",
      "nodeType": "tool",
      "label": "List Entry Types",
      "positionX": 430.0,
      "positionY": 220.0,
      "config": {
        "toolName": "list_entry_types",
        "inputBindings": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "tool_tags",
      "nodeType": "tool",
      "label": "List Tags",
      "positionX": 430.0,
      "positionY": 420.0,
      "config": {
        "toolName": "list_tags",
        "inputBindings": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "llm_materialize",
      "nodeType": "llm",
      "label": "Materialize Fields",
      "positionX": 860.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "systemPrompt": "You are MindAtlas's smart context capture workflow. Convert one high-value context block into final persistence fields.\n\nGoals:\n- Use only the submitted context and invocation metadata to produce the final title, summary, content, type_code, tags, time_mode, and time fields.\n- Do not require the caller to hand-assemble title, summary, type, tags, or time fields.\n- Do not invent facts the user did not imply. You may only organize, normalize, and lightly synthesize what was actually provided.\n\nConstraints:\n- type_code must be selected from the codes in {{tool_types.items}} only. If unsure, pick the first available code.\n- tags should prefer existing names from {{tool_tags.items}}. Return at most 5 tags and do not add # prefixes.\n- content should preserve the important facts from the submitted context and may be organized as Markdown, but it must not fabricate new facts.\n- summary should be one concise paragraph of roughly 50-150 characters.\n- title should be accurate and stay within 30 characters when possible.\n- If the context does not provide clear time information, default to time_mode=POINT and time_at=today in YYYY-MM-DD.\n- Use RANGE only when there is a real time span. When time_mode=POINT, time_from/time_to must be null. When time_mode=RANGE, time_at must be null.",
        "userInput": "date: {{sys.date}}\nsource: {{sys.request_source}}\nchannel: {{sys.request_channel}}\nsession: {{sys.request_session}}\ntool: {{sys.request_tool}}\n\ncontext:\n{{start.context}}",
        "outputMode": "structured",
        "outputFields": [
          {
            "name": "title"
          },
          {
            "name": "summary"
          },
          {
            "name": "content"
          },
          {
            "name": "type_code"
          },
          {
            "name": "tags",
            "type": "array",
            "items_type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "time_mode",
            "enum": [
              "POINT",
              "RANGE"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "time_at",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "time_from",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "time_to",
            "nullable": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "tool_search_candidates",
      "nodeType": "tool",
      "label": "Search Candidates",
      "positionX": 1290.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "toolName": "search_entries",
        "inputBindings": {
          "keyword": "{{llm_materialize.title}}",
          "tag_names": "{{llm_materialize.tags}}",
          "limit": "5"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "llm_decide",
      "nodeType": "llm",
      "label": "Decide Create Or Merge",
      "positionX": 1720.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "systemPrompt": "You are MindAtlas's conservative deduplication decision node. Choose between create and merge with at most one target entry.\n\nRules:\n- You may choose action=merge only when the candidate list contains one clearly matching long-lived entry that should absorb the new context.\n- If the candidate list is empty, ambiguous, only loosely related, or you are not confident that the new context belongs to the same durable record, you must output action=create.\n- entry_id must come from the candidate list ids only. When action=create, entry_id must be null.\n- reason should briefly explain why you chose create or merge.",
        "userInput": "date: {{sys.date}}\nsource: {{sys.request_source}}\nchannel: {{sys.request_channel}}\nsession: {{sys.request_session}}\n\nnew_entry:\n{{llm_materialize.result}}\n\ncandidate_entries:\n{{tool_search_candidates.items}}\n\noriginal_context:\n{{start.context}}",
        "outputMode": "structured",
        "outputFields": [
          {
            "name": "action",
            "enum": [
              "create",
              "merge"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "entry_id",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "reason"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "if_route",
      "nodeType": "if_else",
      "label": "Route",
      "positionX": 2140.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "elseHandle": "create",
        "branches": [
          {
            "id": "merge",
            "label": "MERGE",
            "logic": "and",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "id": "merge_action",
                "variable": "llm_decide.action",
                "operator": "is",
                "value": "merge"
              },
              {
                "id": "merge_entry_id",
                "variable": "llm_decide.entry_id",
                "operator": "is_not_empty",
                "value": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "tool_get_existing",
      "nodeType": "tool",
      "label": "Get Existing Entry",
      "positionX": 2560.0,
      "positionY": 220.0,
      "config": {
        "toolName": "get_entry_detail",
        "inputBindings": {
          "entry_id": "{{llm_decide.entry_id}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "llm_merge_rewrite",
      "nodeType": "llm",
      "label": "Rewrite Merged Entry",
      "positionX": 2980.0,
      "positionY": 220.0,
      "config": {
        "systemPrompt": "You are MindAtlas's entry merger. Rewrite one final canonical record by combining the existing entry with the new high-value context.\n\nGoals:\n- Start from the existing record and absorb the new facts, progress, conclusions, and time clues from the new context.\n- Output the new final title, summary, content, type_code, tags, time_mode, and time fields that should replace the current entry.\n- Use a full rewrite strategy: the content should become one coherent updated record, not a simple append.\n\nConstraints:\n- Use only facts that appear in existing_entry and original_context. Do not invent details.\n- type_code must be selected from the codes in {{tool_types.items}} only.\n- tags should prefer existing names from {{tool_tags.items}}. Return at most 5 tags and do not add # prefixes.\n- content should preserve the important facts from both the old record and the new context and may be organized as Markdown, but it must not fabricate new facts.\n- summary should be one concise paragraph of roughly 50-150 characters.\n- title should be accurate and stay within 30 characters when possible.\n- If the new context provides better time information, you may update the time fields; otherwise preserve or reasonably continue the existing time framing.",
        "userInput": "date: {{sys.date}}\nsource: {{sys.request_source}}\nchannel: {{sys.request_channel}}\nsession: {{sys.request_session}}\n\nexisting_entry:\n{{tool_get_existing.result}}\n\nnew_materialized_entry:\n{{llm_materialize.result}}\n\noriginal_context:\n{{start.context}}",
        "outputMode": "structured",
        "outputFields": [
          {
            "name": "title"
          },
          {
            "name": "summary"
          },
          {
            "name": "content"
          },
          {
            "name": "type_code"
          },
          {
            "name": "tags",
            "type": "array",
            "items_type": "string"
          },
          {
            "name": "time_mode",
            "enum": [
              "POINT",
              "RANGE"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "time_at",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "time_from",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "time_to",
            "nullable": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
